MediaShare Pro API Documentation v2.4.1
=======================================

Authentication:
- All API endpoints require session authentication
- Login via POST /login.php with username and password

Endpoints:
- GET /api/status.php - System status (public)
- GET /api/files.php - List uploaded files (requires auth)
- POST /upload.php - Upload new file (requires auth)

Rate Limiting:
- 100 requests per minute per IP
- 10 MB max upload size

For more information, contact support@mediashare-pro.local
